      "notes": "事实锚点已核实：agent/observability/acr.py 定义 CORE_INTERVENTION_WEIGHTS（§6.1 七项）、EXTENDED_INTERVENTION_WEIGHTS 与 INTERVENTION_WEIGHTS = 二者合并。",
